<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Presupuesto de Vidrios – Cristalería PRO</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #f5f7fa;
            --card: #ffffff;
            --primary: #1a73e8;
            --primary-dark: #1557b0;
            --accent: #00b4d8;
            --text: #1f2937;
            --text-light: #6b7280;
            --border: #e5e7eb;
            --success: #10b981;
            --warning: #f59e0b;
            --danger: #ef4444;
            --radius: 12px;
            --shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            --shadow-lg: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
            --transition: 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .app-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Header */
        .app-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a1628 0%, #1a2a4a 50%, #0d2137 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 28px 32px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .app-header::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -60px;
            right: -40px;
            width: 180px;
            height: 180px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .app-header h1 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .app-header .subtitle {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            opacity: 0.8;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-top: 4px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            margin-top: 8px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        /* Progress */
        .progress-bar {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0;
            padding: 0 32px;
            background: #fafbfc;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            overflow-x: auto;
        }
        .progress-step {
            flex: 1;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 14px 8px;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--text-light);
            position: relative;
            cursor: default;
            white-space: nowrap;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .progress-step.active {
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .progress-step.done {
            color: var(--success);
        }
        .progress-step::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 10%;
            width: 80%;
            height: 3px;
            background: transparent;
            border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }
        .progress-step.active::after {
            background: var(--primary);
        }
        .progress-step.done::after {
            background: var(--success);
        }

        /* Main form area */
        .form-body {
            padding: 28px 32px 20px;
            min-height: 420px;
        }
        .step-panel {
            display: none;
            animation: fadeSlideIn 0.35s ease;
        }
        .step-panel.active {
            display: block;
        }
        @keyframes fadeSlideIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(14px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .step-panel h2 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        }
        .step-panel .step-desc {
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* Form elements */
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }
        label {
            display: block;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            color: var(--text);
        }
        .label-hint {
            font-weight: 400;
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }
        select,
        input[type="text"],
        input[type="email"],
        input[type="tel"],
        input[type="number"],
        textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 11px 14px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-family: inherit;
            transition: var(--transition);
            background: #fafbfc;
            color: var(--text);
        }
        select:focus,
        input:focus,
        textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(26, 115, 232, 0.08);
            background: #fff;
        }
        textarea {
            resize: vertical;
            min-height: 80px;
        }
        .radio-group,
        .checkbox-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        .radio-card,
        .checkbox-card {
            flex: 1 1 calc(33% - 10px);
            min-width: 130px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 14px 10px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition);
            background: #fafbfc;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            user-select: none;
            position: relative;
        }
        .radio-card:hover,
        .checkbox-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            background: #f0f9ff;
        }
        .radio-card input,
        .checkbox-card input {
            position: absolute;
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .radio-card.selected,
        .checkbox-card.selected {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            background: #e8f0fe;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 700;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(26, 115, 232, 0.06);
        }
        .radio-card .icon,
        .checkbox-card .icon {
            display: block;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        /* File upload */
        .file-upload-area {
            border: 2px dashed var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition);
            background: #fafbfc;
            position: relative;
        }
        .file-upload-area:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            background: #f0f9ff;
        }
        .file-upload-area .upload-icon {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .file-upload-area .upload-text {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .file-upload-area .upload-hint {
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }
        .file-upload-area input {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            opacity: 0;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .file-name {
            margin-top: 8px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--success);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Buttons */
        .btn-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            padding: 20px 32px;
            background: #fafbfc;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .btn {
            padding: 11px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
            transition: var(--transition);
            font-family: inherit;
            letter-spacing: -0.2px;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: var(--primary-dark);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(26, 115, 232, 0.3);
        }
        .btn-outline {
            background: white;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
            color: var(--text);
        }
        .btn-outline:hover {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        .btn-success {
            background: var(--success);
            color: white;
        }
        .btn-success:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
        }

        /* Glass type cards */
        .glass-cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr));
            gap: 10px;
        }
        .glass-card {
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-align: center;
            transition: var(--transition);
            background: #fafbfc;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .glass-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            background: #f0f9ff;
        }
        .glass-card.selected {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            background: #e8f0fe;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(26, 115, 232, 0.06);
        }

        /* Summary */
        .summary-box {
            background: #f0fdf4;
            border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .summary-box h3 {
            color: #065f46;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
        .summary-box ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .summary-box li {
            padding: 4px 0;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #d1fae5;
        }
        .summary-box li:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .summary-box strong {
            color: #065f46;
        }

        /* Toast */
        .toast {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            background: #1f2937;
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 22px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            z-index: 999;
            animation: slideInRight 0.4s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
        }
        @keyframes slideInRight {
            from {
                transform: translateX(120%);
                opacity: 0;
            }
            to {
                transform: translateX(0);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        .required-star {
            color: var(--danger);
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .app-header {
                padding: 20px 16px;
            }
            .form-body {
                padding: 20px 16px;
            }
            .btn-row {
                padding: 16px;
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .btn {
                width: 100%;
                text-align: center;
            }
            .glass-cards {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="app-container">
        <!-- HEADER -->
        <div class="app-header">
            <h1>🪟 Presupuesto Inteligente de Vidrios</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Cristalería PRO – Asesoramiento personalizado</p>
            <span class="badge">💎 Desde 1985</span>
        </div>

        <!-- PROGRESS -->
        <div class="progress-bar" id="progressBar">
            <div class="progress-step active" data-step="1">🧭 Modo</div>
            <div class="progress-step" data-step="2">📐 Uso</div>
            <div class="progress-step" data-step="3">📏 Medidas</div>
            <div class="progress-step" data-step="4">🔧 Manufactura</div>
            <div class="progress-step" data-step="5">🪞 Vidrio</div>
            <div class="progress-step" data-step="6">👤 Datos</div>
            <div class="progress-step" data-step="7">✅ Resumen</div>
        </div>

        <!-- FORM BODY -->
        <form id="glassForm" class="form-body" novalidate>
            <!-- STEP 1: Modo -->
            <div class="step-panel active" data-step="1">
                <h2>¿Cómo quieres proceder?</h2>
                <p class="step-desc">Elige la experiencia que mejor se adapte a ti.</p>
                <div class="radio-group" id="modoGroup">
                    <label class="radio-card selected" data-value="experto">
                        <span class="icon">⚡</span> Sé lo que necesito<br><small>Formulario rápido</small>
                        <input type="radio" name="modo" value="experto" checked hidden>
                    </label>
                    <label class="radio-card" data-value="asesorado">
                        <span class="icon">🤝</span> Necesito asesoramiento<br><small>Paso a paso guiado</small>
                        <input type="radio" name="modo" value="asesorado" hidden>
                    </label>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- STEP 2: Uso del vidrio -->
            <div class="step-panel" data-step="2">
                <h2>¿Para qué necesitas el vidrio?</h2>
                <p class="step-desc">Esto nos ayudará a recomendarte el tipo ideal.</p>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <select id="usoVidrio" name="usoVidrio">
                        <option value="">-- Selecciona un uso --</option>
                        <option value="mesa">🪑 Mesa / Sobremesa</option>
                        <option value="ventana_exterior">🪟 Ventana exterior</option>
                        <option value="ventana_interior">🏠 Ventana interior / tabique</option>
                        <option value="estanteria">📚 Estantería / Balda</option>
                        <option value="mampara">🚿 Mampara de baño</option>
                        <option value="barandilla">🏗️ Barandilla / Escalera</option>
                        <option value="chimenea">🔥 Cristal para chimenea (Neoceram)</option>
                        <option value="cuadro">🖼️ Cristal para cuadro / marco</option>
                        <option value="transitable">🚶 Cristal transitable / Suelo</option>
                        <option value="doble_acristalamiento">🪟 Doble acristalamiento / Climalit</option>
                        <option value="decorativo">🎨 Decorativo / Lacado</option>
                        <option value="espejo">🪞 Espejo</option>
                        <option value="cocina">🍳 Encimera / Trasera de cocina</option>
                        <option value="escaparate">🏬 Escaparate comercial</option>
                        <option value="otro">❓ Otro (especificar)</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group" id="otroUsoGroup" style="display:none;">
                    <label for="otroUso">Especifica el uso:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="otroUso" name="otroUso" placeholder="Describe brevemente...">
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- STEP 3: Medidas -->
            <div class="step-panel" data-step="3">
                <h2>Medidas del vidrio</h2>
                <p class="step-desc">Indica las dimensiones o sube un plano/foto.</p>
                <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr; gap:12px;">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Ancho (mm) <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                        <input type="number" id="ancho" name="ancho" placeholder="Ej: 800" min="10" max="6000">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Alto (mm) <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                        <input type="number" id="alto" name="alto" placeholder="Ej: 600" min="10" max="6000">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Grosor (mm)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="grosor" name="grosor" placeholder="Ej: 6" min="2" max="30">
                        <span class="label-hint">Si no lo sabes, lo sugerimos</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-bottom:12px;">
                    <label class="checkbox-card" id="noMedidasCard">
                        <span class="icon">📐</span> No tengo medidas<br><small>Necesito toma de medidas</small>
                        <input type="checkbox" id="noMedidas" name="noMedidas" hidden>
                    </label>
                </div>
                <div class="file-upload-area" id="fileUploadArea">
                    <span class="upload-icon">📎</span>
                    <p class="upload-text">Adjunta plano, croquis o foto</p>
                    <p class="upload-hint">PDF, JPG, PNG – Máx 10 MB</p>
                    <input type="file" id="archivo" name="archivo" accept=".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png">
                </div>
                <div class="file-name" id="fileNameDisplay"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- STEP 4: Manufactura -->
            <div class="step-panel" data-step="4">
                <h2>Opciones de manufactura</h2>
                <p class="step-desc">Selecciona los acabados que necesitas.</p>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Tipo de canto</label>
                    <select id="canto" name="canto">
                        <option value="plano">Plano (estándar)</option>
                        <option value="pulido">Pulido brillante</option>
                        <option value="biselado">Biselado</option>
                        <option value="canteado">Canteado especial</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Taladros</label>
                    <select id="taladros" name="taladros">
                        <option value="0">Ninguno</option>
                        <option value="1">1 taladro</option>
                        <option value="2">2 taladros</option>
                        <option value="3">3 taladros</option>
                        <option value="4">4 o más</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Muescas / Cajas</label>
                    <select id="muescas" name="muescas">
                        <option value="ninguna">Ninguna</option>
                        <option value="esquinas">En esquinas</option>
                        <option value="centrales">Centrales</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Bisel decorativo (mm)</label>
                    <input type="number" id="bisel" name="bisel" placeholder="Ancho en mm (0 = sin bisel)" min="0" max="100"
                    value="0">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="otrosManufactura">Otras especificaciones</label>
                    <textarea id="otrosManufactura" name="otrosManufactura" placeholder="Grabados, serigrafía, texto personalizado..."></textarea>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- STEP 5: Tipo de vidrio -->
            <div class="step-panel" data-step="5">
                <h2>Selecciona el tipo de vidrio</h2>
                <p class="step-desc">Te mostramos las opciones recomendadas según tu uso. <strong>Puedes elegir varias.</strong></p>
                <div class="glass-cards" id="glassCards">
                    <!-- Se llenan dinámicamente -->
                </div>
                <div class="form-group" style="margin-top:16px;">
                    <label for="colorLacado">Color si es lacado (RAL)</label>
                    <input type="text" id="colorLacado" name="colorLacado" placeholder="Ej: RAL 9016 Blanco tráfico">
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- STEP 6: Datos del cliente -->
            <div class="step-panel" data-step="6">
                <h2>Tus datos para el presupuesto</h2>
                <p class="step-desc">Con esta información creamos tu ficha y te enviamos el presupuesto.</p>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="nombre">Nombre y apellidos / Empresa <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                    <input type="text" id="nombre" name="nombre" placeholder="Ej: Juan García o Cristalería SL" required>
                </div>
                <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px;">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="email">Email <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="cliente@email.com" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="telefono">Teléfono <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                        <input type="tel" id="telefono" name="telefono" placeholder="+34 600 000 000" required>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="direccion">Dirección de entrega</label>
                    <input type="text" id="direccion" name="direccion" placeholder="Calle, número, ciudad...">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="codigoPostal">Código postal</label>
                    <input type="text" id="codigoPostal" name="codigoPostal" placeholder="28001">
                </div>
                <div class="radio-group">
                    <label class="radio-card selected" data-value="particular">
                        <span class="icon">🏠</span> Particular
                        <input type="radio" name="tipoCliente" value="particular" checked hidden>
                    </label>
                    <label class="radio-card" data-value="profesional">
                        <span class="icon">🏢</span> Profesional / Empresa
                        <input type="radio" name="tipoCliente" value="profesional" hidden>
                    </label>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group" style="margin-top:14px;">
                    <label for="urgencia">Nivel de urgencia</label>
                    <select id="urgencia" name="urgencia">
                        <option value="solo_presupuesto">📋 Solo quiero presupuesto, sin prisa</option>
                        <option value="1_3_meses">📅 En 1-3 meses</option>
                        <option value="1_3_semanas">⏳ En 1-3 semanas</option>
                        <option value="urgente">🚨 Lo antes posible (URGENTE)</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- STEP 7: Resumen -->
            <div class="step-panel" data-step="7">
                <h2>✅ Resumen de tu solicitud</h2>
                <p class="step-desc">Revisa los datos antes de enviar. Tu solicitud quedará <strong>pendiente de aprobación</strong>.</p>
                <div class="summary-box" id="summaryBox">
                    <p style="color:#6b7280; font-style:italic;">Cargando resumen...</p>
                </div>
                <p style="margin-top:12px; font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--text-light);">
                    ⚡ Al enviar, crearemos tu ficha en nuestra base de datos. Recibirás un email de confirmación.
                </p>
            </div>
        </form>

        <!-- BUTTONS -->
        <div class="btn-row" id="btnRow">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" id="btnPrev" disabled>⬅ Anterior</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="btnNext">Siguiente ➡</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-success" id="btnSubmit" style="display:none;">📩 Enviar Solicitud</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Toast container -->
    <div id="toastContainer"></div>

    <script>
        (function() {
            // --- STATE ---
            let currentStep = 1;
            const totalSteps = 7;
            const selectedGlassTypes = new Set();
            const formData = {};

            // --- DOM refs ---
            const panels = document.querySelectorAll('.step-panel');
            const progressSteps = document.querySelectorAll('.progress-step');
            const btnPrev = document.getElementById('btnPrev');
            const btnNext = document.getElementById('btnNext');
            const btnSubmit = document.getElementById('btnSubmit');
            const form = document.getElementById('glassForm');
            const glassCardsContainer = document.getElementById('glassCards');
            const summaryBox = document.getElementById('summaryBox');

